# osm2pgsql style for the OGF contour data used by the cyclogf DEM layers.
#
# The contours are phyghtmap output, tagging ways ele / contour / contour_ext,
# where the cyclosm style wants a height column. Only ele is kept here, and the
# contours view maps it to height - see bin/fetchDemData.sh
#
# OsmType  Tag   DataType  Flags
node,way   ele   int4      linear
